In March’s mist and blossoms, he sails down to Yangzhou.
His lone sail fades into the distance beneath the blue sky’s end;
Only the Yangtze is seen flowing toward the horizon."}

{"translation":"A Farewell to Meng Haoran at Yellow Crane Tower, Bound for Guangling

My old friend bids farewell to the Yellow Crane Tower in the west;
Amid mist and blossoms of the third month, he descends upon Yangzhou.
His lone sail, a distant shadow, vanishes into the boundless blue sky;
Only the Yangtze River flows on toward the rim of the world."}

{"translation":"My old friend bade farewell to Yellow Crane Tower in the west,
Amidst blossoms and mist of spring, he sailed down to Yangzhou.
The lone sail’s distant shadow vanished into the azure sky;
Only the long river flows to the edge of heaven."}

