message.content:
{
  "translation": "I often recall the pavilion by the stream at dusk, drunk deep, not knowing the way back.\nWhen my joy was spent, I turned the boat in the evening light, straying into the depths of lotus flowers.\nRow with might! Row with might! Startling a shore full of gulls and herons."
}

{
"translation": "I often recall the pavilion by the stream at sunset, drunk and forgetting the way home. When my joy was spent, I rowed back in the evening boat and strayed into the deep lotus fields. Hurry! Hurry! Startling a flock of gulls and herons from the sand."
}

