message.content:
{
"translation": "I often recall the streamside pavilion at dusk, drunk to the point of losing my way. When the fun was over, I turned my boat back in the evening, only to wander into the depths of lotus flowers. 'Row! Row!' we cried, disturbing a whole beach of gulls and herons."
}

