{
"translation": "The great river flows east, its waves washing away all the heroic figures of a thousand ages. On the west side of the old fortress, it is said to be the Red Cliff where Zhou Yu commanded in the Three Kingdoms era.

Jagged rocks pierce the sky; startling breakers crash onto the shore, rolling up a thousand heaps of snow. The land and river are like a painting—how many heroes emerged in that single moment!

I recall Gongjin in his prime: Xiao Qiao had just become his bride; he was majestic and spirited. With feather fan and silk scarf, laughing as he talked—the enemy's fleet turned to ash and smoke.

My spirit wanders through the ancient kingdom; my sentimental heart should perhaps laugh at myself for growing grey hair so early. Human life is but a dream—I pour this cup of wine as an offering to the moon over the river."
}

{"translation":"The Great River flows east;
Waves wash away all heroes of the ages.
To the west of the ancient fort,
People say it is Red Cliff, where Zhou Yu of the Three Kingdoms fought.
Jagged rocks pierce the sky;
