{
  "translation": "The Great River flows eastward, its waves have washed away all the romantic heroes of a thousand years. To the west of the old fortress, people say this is Red Cliff, where General Zhou of the Three Kingdoms stood. Jagged rocks pierce the sky; startled waves crash against the shore, rolling up thousands of piles of snow. The mountains and rivers are like a painting—how many heroes in that brief moment! I recall Gongjin in his prime: Xiao Qiao had just married him, his heroic bearing splendid and spirited. With a feather fan and silk headscarf, amid laughter and talk, the enemy fleet vanished in smoke and ash. Wandering in spirit through the ancient land, my sentimental nature would surely be laughed at by those who laugh, for I grew grey-haired too early. Human life is but a dream; let me pour one cup of wine as an offering to the river moon."
